<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 25.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 25.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at the Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 24	     March 21</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.692		  5.427</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  31.304		 30.092</p>
<p>Cash balance		  36.996		 35.519</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,283.727	     5,282.673</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $55 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
